WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.377
Music can unlock 
a frozen memory

00:00:03.377 --> 00:00:06.394
that&nbsp;melts into the 
seeds of our creativity.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.923
And the reverse is also true.

00:00:10.478 --> 00:00:13.918
A memory can 
unlock&nbsp;a song

00:00:13.918 --> 00:00:15.888
that's waiting to be written.

00:00:16.161 --> 00:00:18.623
It can reveal us to ourselves

00:00:18.623 --> 00:00:22.000
across time and 
generations,

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.144
in community,
 in solitude.

00:00:25.454 --> 00:00:28.370
Some frequencies 
are sound,

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.332
and some 
frequencies are light.

00:00:31.953 --> 00:00:36.295
And some&nbsp;take 
a half a lifetime

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:39.589
to reach their destination.

